      <segment>
        <source>Advanced Usage of Transfer. You can customize the labels of the transfer buttons, the width and height of the columns, and what should be displayed in the footer.</source>
        <target state="translated">Transfer 的高级用法。可以自定义穿梭按钮标签、列宽和列高，以及页脚中展示的内容。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
